      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Max falls asleep in the restaurant dining room and has an affectionate dream about Chef Viktor Barinov. Barinov violently wakes him up and demands to know why he is sleeping during working hours. Listen to their funny confrontation in Russian first, and then we will examine every line.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
